; ============================================
; Interlock Circuit (インターロック回路)
; Mitsubishi MELSEC Mnemonic Format
; ============================================
; Forward/reverse motor control with interlock.
; Y001 and Y002 cannot be ON at the same time.
; ============================================
LD  X001
ANI X002
OUT Y001
LD  X002
ANI X001
OUT Y002
END
